  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1802.50 Small-scale, short-duration activities (SSSD)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1802.50 “Small-scale, short-duration activities (SSSD)” means “small-scale, short-duration activities (SSSD)” as described in 40 CFR 763, subpart E, appendix C, July 1, 2023 edition, as reprinted in Appendix D, provided that such activities affect no more than 3 linear feet of asbestos surface on pipes or 3 square feet of asbestos-containing building material on the surface of structures other than pipes.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, Revision Note #2, and Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-A 1800) #14104, eff 11-1-24, EXPIRES: 11-1-34",
